  ("0-3","CHANG","Wall sit next to me. I'm 74. Who stops first?","WALL SIT · DUET ME",f"{G} | back slides down garage wall, split-screen space left for duet | eye-level medium-full"),
  ("3-12","CHANG","In 270 trials, wall sits and other holds lowered resting blood pressure the most of any exercise type. On average. Over weeks. Not instantly.","270 trials · over WEEKS · not instantly","same | study card inset (Edwards, BJSM 2023) | medium"),
