  ("19-26","CHANG","Fix two: soft knees, hips back a little, and step closer to the sink.","2 · Soft knees · closer","same | adjusts stance | side medium-full"),
  ("26-33","CHANG","Fix three: every ten minutes, stand tall, hands on your low back, lean back gently. Three times, only if it feels good.","3 · Gentle lean back, if comfortable","same | gentle extension | medium"),
