  ("22-28","CHANG","Getting good? Lift one foot a little. Hand stays near the sink.","Next level: one foot up","same | lifts foot, hand hovering | medium"),
  ("28-34","CHANG","Balance practice is one of the most-studied exercises for our age. 108 trials. Brushing is a good excuse.","108 trials of balance practice","same | study card inset (Cochrane 2019) | medium"),
